# No cartoon Earth, no Dig Quest

Do not add, restore, or regenerate a cartoon globe of Earth’s continents. That includes `assets/hero/morph/hero-1080.mp4`, `era-540.webp`, `era-drift.webp`, `era-today.webp`, `end.webp`, `scripts/morph_v2.py` as a generator, `bsp-globe.js`, and any new spinning cartoon Earth.

Keep flat Scotese PALEOMAP frames (`assets/hero/paleo/`), the lava still and the first-ocean still, and NASA photographs such as the Blue Marble.

Do not put Dig Quest back in navigation, homepage cards, or calls to action, in any language. The sourced layer text stays on `Quest.html` so old URLs are not empty. Do not merge a preview that rebuilds the Dig Quest experience.

The lesson-plan builder stays.
